@template playful
// One of the ten voice templates (the head writer, with social B). Its words match section 20c's VOICE_FALLBACK, so
// baking it changes nothing; the template's own lines (content/templates/playful.lines) come in wave 2.
talk: Jokey, bouncy, competitive in fun; nicknames everything.
hi: Oi oi | Look who it is
bye: Don't be a stranger | Laters
yes: Go on, then | You bet
thanks: Cheers
wow: Get in
sigh: Ah, nuts
nick: - | - | - | champ | champ
needs: cheer
